# Customize Your 1-Frame Tower Setup

Great choice! You've selected our compact 1-Frame Tower, ideal for the smallest spaces with a minimal footprint of 0.5m² and height of 0.5m — perfect for testing or entry-level yields of 2-5kg/year in a single, stackable unit. 

To personalize it further, decide how to divide the frame into modules. Each module acts as a dedicated growing space.

